# Session Restart Notes (~/proj)

_Purpose: if a WSL session dies (OOM during UVM/Verilator builds), read this to
get back up to speed. Cross-repo notes only — repo-specific knowledge lives in
each repo. Updated periodically by Claude._

Last updated: 2026-08-27

## IP-axi-to-2apbs — knowledge MIGRATED into the repo (2026-08-27)
The UVM-on-Verilator work is DONE and green in CI, and all its detail now lives
in the repo itself (not here):
- `IP-axi-to-2apbs/CLAUDE.md` — agent-startup context + repo/workflow gotchas.
- `IP-axi-to-2apbs/uvm/vlt/README.md` — the OSS Verilator UVM flow guide.
