is sidestepped by building in CI.)

## General WSL2 RAM ceiling (applies to ALL repos here)
- Host is ~8 GB physical; WSL sees ~5.7 GB. `.wslconfig memory=16GB` is silently
  ignored (can't exceed physical) — this is why the chipyard "RAM bump" never
  took (see [[chipyard_install_state]]). Swap = 8 GB on /dev/sdc, nproc = 12.
- Verilator `--lint-only` of a UVM bench is cheap (~330 MB). The full `--binary`
  g++ compile OOMs and can kill the whole WSL VM/session. Strategy: lint locally;
  run the heavy `--binary` build in cloud CI, or locally only with
  `--build-jobs 1 --CFLAGS -O0` under a `ulimit -v` guard in a subshell so a
  blowup dies alone.

## General OSS Verilator UVM toolchain (see memory [[oss-uvm-verilator]])
- `~/verilator/bin/verilator` = Verilator 5.050 — the ONLY local one that runs
  UVM. The OSS CAD Suite Verilator does NOT.
- **`unset VERILATOR_ROOT`** after sourcing `~/oss-cad-suite/environment` — the
  stale value it exports makes `~/verilator/bin/verilator` hard-error.
- `UVM_HOME` = `~/verilator/test_regress/t/uvm` (bundled Accellera UVM 2020.3.1:
  `uvm_pkg_all_v2020_3_1_dpi.svh` + `v2020_3_1/dpi/uvm_dpi.cc`).
- Other UVM benches to port next (same pattern): `~/proj/*/uvm`,
  `chi-to-bow-bridge/uvm_bench` (VCS), `axi-on-ucie-to-mem`, `uvm_review`,
  `si5_prep`. `chi-to-bow-bridge/vlate_bench` is a C++ TB, not UVM.

## Git / push gotcha (this environment)
- SSH `origin` (`git@github.com:...`) fails auth here. Push over HTTPS — `gh` is
  logged in as `markrthomas`:
  `git push https://github.com/markrthomas/<repo>.git <branch>`
